2026-10-19T04:58:05.7901413Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8005206Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8015877Z [0m
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8016479Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8016999Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8017779Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8018027Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8018562Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8018873Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8019254Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8019964Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8020276Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8021331Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8022354Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8023137Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8024096Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8024958Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8025733Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8026555Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8027340Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8028300Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8028901Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8029430Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8029686Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8030328Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8031254Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8031996Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8032182Z I will:
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8032557Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8032884Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8033626Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8034636Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8035314Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8035627Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8036196Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8036612Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8037415Z    /root
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8048818Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8049688Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8061437Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8062196Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8062683Z 
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8064799Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-19T04:58:05.8065513Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
